.TH ORO-SERVICE-WORKER-STORAGE 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:service\-worker/storage \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:service\-worker/storage'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:service\-worker/storage is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBIndexIterator\fR
