\fBStorage\fR
A generic interface for storage implementations
.TP
\fBcreate(token)\fR
A factory for creating a `Storage` instance that is backed by a storage provider. Extending classes should define a `Provider` class that is statically available on the extended `Storage` class.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fItoken\fR (symbol; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<Proxy<Storage>>\fR
.TP
\fBprovider()\fR
A readonly reference to the storage provider.
.TP
\fBlength()\fR
The number of entries in the storage.
.TP
\fBhasItem(key)\fR
Returns `true` if the storage has a value for a given `key`.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIkey\fR (string; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIboolean\fR
.TP
\fBclear()\fR
Clears the storage of all entries
.TP
\fBkey(index)\fR
Returns the key at a given `index`
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIindex\fR (number; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIstring \\| null\fR
.TP
\fBgetItem(key)\fR
Get a storage value item for a given `key`.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIkey\fR (string; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIstring \\| null\fR
.TP
\fBremoveItem((Position 0))\fR
Removes a storage value entry for a given `key`.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fI(Position 0)\fR (string; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIboolean\fR
.TP
\fBsetItem(key, value)\fR
Sets a storage item `value` for a given `key`.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIkey\fR (string; required)
.br
\fIvalue\fR (string; required)
.TP
\fBMemoryStorage (extends Storage)\fR
An in\-memory `Storage` interface.
.TP
\fBLocalStorage (extends Storage)\fR
A locally persisted `Storage` interface.
.TP
\fBSessionStorage (extends Storage)\fR
A session `Storage` interface.
.TP
\fBcreateStorageInterface(type)\fR
A factory for creating storage interfaces.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fItype\fR (\&'memoryStorage' \\| 'localStorage' \\| 'sessionStorage'; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<Storage>\fR
